  "question": {
    "text": "Given below are two statements<br />Statement I : A catalyst cannot alter the equilibrium constant $\\left(\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{c}}\\right)$ of the reaction, temperature remaining constant<br />Statement II : A homogenous catalyst can change the equilibrium composition of a system temperature remaining constant<br />In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below",
    "image": null
  },
